    "MEASURED PRIOR for alien unit production. Copy to <server>/UserData/.",
    "Read at map load. Delete the file and the mod falls back to its",
    "built-in ordering, which is the most expensive option a producer",
    "offers \u2014 the rule this table exists to replace.",
    "",
    "effectiveness \u2014 kill/death with AI on BOTH sides, from replays. Not",
    "  the aggregate: the aggregate is dominated by units players pilot.",
    "counters \u2014 cash destroyed per cash lost against each class of enemy,",
    "  under AI control. Cash rather than kills, because a Scorpion kills",
    "  Militia 367:1 and that says infantry are cheap, not that Scorpions",
    "  counter them. Priced properly the same matchup is 0.97.",
    "cap \u2014 the scarce resource once the bank runs 100k unspent. The mod",
    "  scores per cap point, not per cash.",
    "",
    "Classes are the game's own factories: Barracks, Light, Heavy, Ultra",
    "Heavy, Air. A missing counter entry means UNMEASURED, never bad \u2014",
    "below the thresholds there was not enough of that matchup to price.",
    "",
    "This is a starting opinion, meant to be overwritten by what the bot",
    "measures itself. Edit any number; it takes effect next map load."
